  - `read_word()` — extract Word doc
  - `read_spreadsheet()` — read Excel
  - `view_image()` — OCR/analyze images

**2. ComputerController** ([goose-mcp/computercontroller/](reference/goose/crates/goose-mcp/src/computercontroller)):
