    pub is_malicious: bool,
    pub confidence: f32,
    pub explanation: String,
    pub should_ask_user: bool,
    pub finding_id: String,
}
```

### 13b. Tool Inspection & Repetition Detection

**Tool Monitor** ([tool_monitor.rs](reference/goose/crates/goose/src/tool_monitor.rs)):

- **RepetitionInspector**: Detects if agent is looping on same tool
  - Tracks last N tool calls
  - Alerts if > threshold repeats of same tool
  - Triggers auto-retry or user notification

**Tool Call Labels** ([tool_call_labels.rs](reference/goose/crates/goose/src/tool_call_labels.rs)):
- Annotate tool calls with approval status
- Track execution time, error rate
- Audit trail for security review

### 13c. Extension Validation

**Malware Check** ([agents/extension_malware_check.rs](reference/goose/crates/goose/src/agents/extension_malware_check.rs)):

- Scans downloaded MCP servers for known malware signatures
- Uses `clamav` or fallback pattern matching
- Prompts user before enabling untrusted extension

**Process Sandboxing:**
- MCP servers spawned as child processes with limited privileges
- Stdio-only communication (no arbitrary IPC)
- Timeout enforcement (default 60s per tool call)
- Memory limits via OS process controls

